        {
          "id": "2e7cd2f9-0927-431e-bddd-35e56df285f0",
          "name": "LinkedIn Update a Creative",
          "request": {
            "name": "LinkedIn Update a Creative",
            "description": {
              "content": "You can change the details of following Creatives fields:\n\n\\*   `intendedStatus`:\n\\*   `leadgenCallToAction`: field `adFormUrn` - The ad form that is a target destination for the `callToAction` button. It can only be modified when the creative is in DRAFT status. It is read only once it is set for a creative and once it transitions to any non-draft intended status.\n\\*   `leadgenCallToAction`: field label `-Label` for the `callToAction` button\n    \n\n  \nThis API updates a sponsored creative.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "creatives",
                ":creative ID"
